    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRODUCTION</h2>Bodega brings you back in time to 1990's Brooklyn NYC. Become the owner of a wide variety of bodega convenience stores scattered around the neighborhood. With many tasks and chores, on top of the never ending customers, you will sure have a lot on your plate!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/ea5c4490610491301217e00e60a0ca46.poster.avif?t=1721603601\" width=426 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/ea5c4490610491301217e00e60a0ca46.webm?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/ea5c4490610491301217e00e60a0ca46.mp4?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN DEPTH CUSTOMER INTERACTION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Shoplifting &amp; Robbery<br></li><li> Hunger &amp; Thirst<br></li><li> Dialogue Options<br></li><li> Unique customer Questlines/interactions<br></li><li>Combat<br></li><li>Favorite Items<br></li><li>Loyalty and Happiness</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/6c0b66cab617401485e8d482ecfebc89.poster.avif?t=1721603601\" width=426 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/6c0b66cab617401485e8d482ecfebc89.webm?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/6c0b66cab617401485e8d482ecfebc89.mp4?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING &amp; COOKING</h2>With many types of food and beverage recipes, you'll have no problem finding your favorite way to resolve customer needs! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/8673e96bd1f4764fbb8d8ad4d1c5414d.poster.avif?t=1721603601\" width=426 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/8673e96bd1f4764fbb8d8ad4d1c5414d.webm?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/8673e96bd1f4764fbb8d8ad4d1c5414d.mp4?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A speaking bodega cat companion </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive Caretaking and Interaction<br></li><li>Humorous commentary based on nearby events<br></li><li>Secret celebrity voice actor</li></ul><br>AND MANY MORE",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRODUCTION</h2>Bodega brings you back in time to 1990's Brooklyn NYC. Become the owner of a wide variety of bodega convenience stores scattered around the neighborhood. With many tasks and chores, on top of the never ending customers, you will sure have a lot on your plate!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/ea5c4490610491301217e00e60a0ca46.poster.avif?t=1721603601\" width=426 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/ea5c4490610491301217e00e60a0ca46.webm?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/ea5c4490610491301217e00e60a0ca46.mp4?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN DEPTH CUSTOMER INTERACTION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Shoplifting &amp; Robbery<br></li><li> Hunger &amp; Thirst<br></li><li> Dialogue Options<br></li><li> Unique customer Questlines/interactions<br></li><li>Combat<br></li><li>Favorite Items<br></li><li>Loyalty and Happiness</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/6c0b66cab617401485e8d482ecfebc89.poster.avif?t=1721603601\" width=426 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/6c0b66cab617401485e8d482ecfebc89.webm?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/6c0b66cab617401485e8d482ecfebc89.mp4?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFTING &amp; COOKING</h2>With many types of food and beverage recipes, you'll have no problem finding your favorite way to resolve customer needs! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/8673e96bd1f4764fbb8d8ad4d1c5414d.poster.avif?t=1721603601\" width=426 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/8673e96bd1f4764fbb8d8ad4d1c5414d.webm?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853280/extras/8673e96bd1f4764fbb8d8ad4d1c5414d.mp4?t=1721603601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A speaking bodega cat companion </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive Caretaking and Interaction<br></li><li>Humorous commentary based on nearby events<br></li><li>Secret celebrity voice actor</li></ul><br>AND MANY MORE",
